WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:21.406
Tom gave the new nightcap to the royal grandmother.

2
00:00:21.407 --> 00:00:25.024
"What took you so long?" she snapped.

3
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:28.490
She put the nightcap on her head.

4
00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:33.204
"Now I wish for a guard!" she said.

5
00:00:33.205 --> 00:00:37.993
Poof! A guard dog appeared.

6
00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:40.390
It had three heads.

7
00:00:40.391 --> 00:00:43.207
They all growled at Tom.

8
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.966
The royal grandmother looked at Tom.

9
00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:49.246
"Your magic is getting better, Wizard!"

10
00:00:49.247 --> 00:00:54.259
Tom shook his head. "I didn't do anything."

11
00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.831
"Tom," Cat whispered.

12
00:00:56.832 --> 00:01:00.261
"I think the nightcap is a wishing cap."

13
00:01:00.262 --> 00:01:04.939
Tom gasped. "A wishing cap?"

14
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.944
"A wishing cap?" said the royal grandmother.

15
00:01:08.945 --> 00:01:13.635
"Hmm. I wish this dog was a tiger."

16
00:01:13.636 --> 00:01:21.971
Poof! The dog turned into a tiger.

17
00:01:21.972 --> 00:01:24.414
The royal grandmother smiled.

18
00:01:24.415 --> 00:01:28.248
"I've always wanted a wishing cap!" she said.

19
00:01:28.249 --> 00:01:38.047
Tom bowed. "I'm glad you're happy."

20
00:01:38.048 --> 00:01:43.653
Tom found the king.

21
00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:47.059
"The royal grandmother is happy now," he said.

22
00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.564
"All her wishes came true."

23
00:01:50.565 --> 00:01:58.069
The king clapped. "Wonderful, Tom!"

24
00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.946
"Be careful, Tom," Cat whispered.

25
00:02:00.947 --> 00:02:02.771
"Wishing caps are—"

26
00:02:02.772 --> 00:02:07.798
Poof! Suddenly the king's throne disappeared.

27
00:02:07.799 --> 00:02:10.460
"Ack!" cried the king. "Oof!"

28
00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:15.578
He landed hard on the floor.

29
00:02:15.579 --> 00:02:18.972
The royal grandmother sat on her new throne.

30
00:02:18.973 --> 00:02:22.495
"What a nice throne!" she said.

31
00:02:22.496 --> 00:02:26.576
"I like that tiger too.

32
00:02:26.577 --> 00:02:32.920
Maybe I'll stay at this castle forever!"
